Effects in forge-ordnance-fx.bundle come from Unity Asset Store packs and are shipped only inside this built bundle; the packs' own files are not
redistributed. Pack, licence as recorded by the effect library, effects used:

Forge own effects
  Forge's own effect, generated by ForgeVfxOwnEffects.cs
  ord_beacon_impact, ord_beacon_pillar, ord_hand_pulse, ord_pod_fall, ord_pod_glow, ord_pod_gravel, ord_pod_land, ord_pod_vent, ord_sentry_expired, ord_sentry_online, ord_servo_sparks

Free Quick Effects Vol 1
  Standard Unity Asset Store EULA (may ship inside built mod bundles; raw assets must not be redistributed or committed)
  ord_beacon_impact, ord_beacon_pillar, ord_hand_pulse, ord_sentry_online

War FX
  Standard Unity Asset Store EULA (may ship inside built mod bundles; raw assets must not be redistributed or committed)
  ord_pod_fall, ord_pod_gravel, ord_pod_land, ord_pod_vent, ord_sentry_expired

